    <txttips>
        <txttip left="144" top="681" right="941" bottom="838" content="Instructions:&#x0D;&#x0A;&#x0D;&#x0A;1.Start up the devices&#x0D;&#x0A;2.Configure the name of the router as DHCP SERVER.&#x0D;&#x0A;3.We are using our router as our dhcp server following the steps below.&#x0D;&#x0A;  a.Enable dhcp on dhcp server&#x0D;&#x0A;  b.Put ip address on G0/0/0 -10.10.10.1/24&#x0D;&#x0A;  c.Let the dhcp work on the interfaces G0/0/0&#x0D;&#x0A;  d.Configure the pull to provide dns(9.9.9.9) ,the lease period should be 3 days and exclude 10.10.10.2&#x0D;&#x0A;4.Enable dhcp on PC1 PC2" fontname="Consolas" fontstyle="0" editsize="100" txtcolor="-16777216" txtbkcolor="-4144960" charset="1" />
    </txttips>
